  "findings": [
    "Finite running samples show NI124WPs plus queued buffers and hardware pool14 taildrop while DMA descriptors are all consumed and RPQ/ARM queues are empty; posttest zero backlog had hidden this stall.",
    "Healthy200 and400Mbps UDP loop samples do not show such sustained completion stall; no firmware performance fix was installed to obtain these results.",
    "TCP 580Mbps loop on3.23% of4cores still has312retransmits and44-packet difference before second FE hit while PHY TX/RX counters exactly agree. All FE flow drop counters and global QM taildrop remain0. Packet loss location is not yet proved; do not call all retransmits CPU16 taildrops."
  ],
